  "helpYandexTitle": "Yandex Music",
  "helpYandexBody": "Shows your cached and refreshed Yandex Music library: liked tracks, playlists and liked albums. It does not upload local files to Yandex Music.",
  "helpLocalTitle": "Local Library",
  "helpLocalBody": "Indexes configured local music folders. Scanning reads your audio files and updates the MusicArk index; it does not rewrite or delete the audio files.",
  "helpMatchingTitle": "Matching",
  "helpMatchingBody": "Connects a Yandex track identity with a local file using available evidence. Matching answers which track it is; Variant analysis separately checks whether the recording/version differs.",
  "helpMissingTitle": "Missing",
  "helpMissingBody": "Shows provider tracks that are not currently covered by an acceptable local file. A Different Version result is a separate review state and is not automatically equivalent to Missing.",
  "helpDownloadsTitle": "Downloads",
  "helpDownloadsBody": "Shows requested acquisitions and their status. Downloads are explicit tasks; this section does not silently rewrite existing local files.",
  "helpSyncTitle": "Sync",
  "helpSyncBody": "Builds and applies a controlled plan for wanted missing tracks. Sync does not delete local-only files and does not automatically replace a Different Version recording.",
  "helpMetadataTitle": "Metadata Editor",
  "helpMetadataBody": "Explicitly edits supported metadata of one existing local file. Apply Metadata writes selected metadata but does not confirm identity. Apply + Bind writes metadata and explicitly binds the file to the selected provider identity.",
